read. During the midnight chime, a mysterious figure appears dressed as the Red Death itself, drenched in blood and wearing a corpse-like mask, causing terror and paralysis among the guests. Prince Prospero, enraged, pursues the figure through all seven rooms with a dagger, only to collapse dead upon confronting it in the black chamber—revealing the figure to be empty, as the plague has infiltrated even their sanctuary, claiming every life as the lights extinguish and darkness claims all.\"\n    34→    }\n    35→  ],\n    36→  \"characters\": [\n    37→    {\n    38→      \"id\": \"char_the_prince_prospero_d85685e9\",\n    39→      \"canonical_name\": \"the Prince Prospero\",\n    40→      \"aliases\": [],\n    41→      \"role\": null,\n    42→      \"appearance\": null,\n    43→      \"personality\": null,\n    44→      \"voice_guidance\": null,\n    45→      \"descriptions\": [],\n    46→      \"relationships\": {},\n    47→      \"evidence\": [],\n    48→      \"voice_notes\": null,\n    49→      \"first_appearance_chapter\": 1,\n    50→      \"mention_count\": 3,\n    51→      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n    52→      \"is_narrator\": false,\n    53→      \"narrative_role\": null\n    54→    },\n    55→    {\n    56→      \"id\": \"425644eb-8f8c-4772-bc09-33529767a9ca\",\n    57→      \"canonical_name\": \"the mummer\",\n    58→      \"aliases\": [\n    59→        \"Prospero\"\n    60→      ],\n    61→      \"role\": null,\n    62→      \"appearance\": null,\n    63→      \"personality\": null,\n    64→      \"voice_guidance\": null,\n    65→      \"descriptions\": [],\n    66→      \"relationships\": {},\n    67→      \"evidence\": [],\n    68→      \"voice_notes\": null,\n    69→      \"first_appearance_chapter\": 1,\n    70→      \"mention_count\": 4,\n    71→      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n    72→      \"is_narrator\": false,\n    73→      \"narrative_role\": null\n    74→    }\n    75→  ],\n    76→  \"pronunciations\": [\n    77→    {\n    78→      \"word\":